<speak>My <sub alias="eff eye en">FIN</sub> is <sub alias="eff">F</sub> zero three two six one seven five <sub alias="aitch">H</sub>. My date of birth is the seventh of September nineteen sixty-five. I've moved the keyboard away a little so I won't accidentally click anything while talking. The notebook is easier for me anyway. At work, everything is on a shared system now, but for personal matters I still like a page where I can see the whole conversation. My handwriting isn't wonderful, but at least I know where I've put it. Otherwise I end up searching through several different applications.</speak>